; Layout:
;   MainMenu (Node2D, script)
;   ├─ CanvasLayer (0)
;   │  └─ Root (Control, full screen)
;   │     ├─ Wall / Dim          – tiled corridor wall, darkened
;   │     ├─ Title / Tagline     – pixel font
;   │     ├─ Menu (LanternMenu)  – SPIELEN, OPTIONEN (left of centre)
;   │     ├─ ScoreboardPanel     – best list (right of centre)
;   │     └─ OptionsMenu         – overlay, hidden until opened
;   └─ WorldFilter (layer 1): colour grade; the menu flips worlds by itself
